 Result Management System

Project Overview

This project is a responsive web application developed using HTML, CSS, and JavaScript.

It allows users to enter student details and marks, calculate total marks and percentage, and display the result.

Features

- Student details validation
- Marks validation
- Automatic calculation of total marks and percentage
- Pass/Fail result calculation
- Display of student results
- JSON data conversion
- Local Storage support

Technologies Used

- HTML5
- CSS3
- JavaScript

How to Run

1. Download or clone this repository.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Open the "index.html" file in your browser.

